# Old domain -> new domain. challenger-house.com is attached to this site as a
# plain domain alias, which serves the site directly rather than redirecting,
# so it needs an explicit host-based rule to forward it to the new primary.
https://challenger-house.com/*      https://www.challenger.house/:splat   301!
https://www.challenger-house.com/*  https://www.challenger.house/:splat   301!

